{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人植耀輝於節目中表示，看好台積電(TSM)，理由是第2季業績表現理想，有望繼續受惠AI發展，加上集團調高全年營收增長預測，至略高於四成，均有望利好股價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026bvJTnz9EoV1784275247.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">植耀輝建議於周五美股開市時入市，目標價上望500美元，若失守350美元就止蝕離場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">台積電(TSM)投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價→周五美股開市價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　500美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　350美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026rXgB47BCQH1784275258.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人張智威就提到，推介江西銅業(358)，主要受惠倫敦期銅價格，突破14,000美元，市場需求仍強勁，加上集團業績理想，現價估值也合理，均利好後市表現。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026FCh5fjh9je1784275272.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張智威建議於現價，即約30.8元水平買入，目標價定於35元，若跌穿28元就先行止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江西銅業(358)投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價→$30.8</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$35</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$30→$28</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026MKYLq39bMg1784275286.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T08:21:09.832146+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}